This project depends on third-party software components, such as Spring Boot and the
PostgreSQL JDBC driver and the other Maven dependencies it builds on, and the PostgreSQL
container image used for local development. Those components are subject to their own
license terms and notices.

The bundled openapi.yaml describes ShareLLM Server's own API. Its Ollama-compatible
endpoints follow the Ollama API (https://github.com/ollama/ollama), which is a separate
project licensed under its own terms.
